{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PONGBANG</strong> is a digital board game inspired by Russian roulette, reimagined with a fun and strategic twist. Players take turns surviving high-stakes rounds while using item cards to prank, sabotage, or protect themselves. The last player standing wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling mix of luck, bluffing, and backstabbing \u2014 PONGBANG is perfect for parties and chaotic game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player begins with 5 HP and must outlast everyone else to be the final survivor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one gun and one bullet, players either shoot themselves or use cards to redirect the shot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action cards let you attack, defend, heal, reload, or trick opponents to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a chance to win thanks to randomized hit locations, where each spot inflicts different damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645310?t=1757079094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645310/d128cb31438f344cc0a365b7f8bd7ae534443d59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757079094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645310/55fb2bcd0bafc40bb3442e17c3a6d65be54d4930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757079094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645310/55fb2bcd0bafc40bb3442e17c3a6d65be54d4930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757079094","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features firearms and frequent shooting of other players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PONGBANG</strong> is a digital board game inspired by Russian roulette, reimagined with a fun and strategic twist. Players take turns surviving high-stakes rounds while using item cards to prank, sabotage, or protect themselves. The last player standing wins the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling mix of luck, bluffing, and backstabbing \u2014 PONGBANG is perfect for parties and chaotic game nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player begins with 5 HP and must outlast everyone else to be the final survivor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only one gun and one bullet, players either shoot themselves or use cards to redirect the shot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Cards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action cards let you attack, defend, heal, reload, or trick opponents to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has a chance to win thanks to randomized hit locations, where each spot inflicts different damage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["LuminDrive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","i